    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "0DC138C9AC11B219",
      "text": "블루베리그에서는 수고 많았어.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "0DC135C9AC11AD00",
      "text": "챔피언이 바뀐 덕분에\\n긴장된 분위기도 많이 누그러진 것 같아![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "0DC136C9AC11AEB3",
      "text": "개인적으로는 카지와도\\n즐겁게 지내고 싶었지만 말이지...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "0DC13BC9AC11B732",
      "text": "...뭐든지 상상한 대로 되라는 법은\\n없는 모양이야.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "AF30C322A3B69568",
      "text": "괜찮아질 거예요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "AF30C622A3B69A81",
      "text": "그렇게 될 거예요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "0DC13CC9AC11B8E5",
      "text": "과연 챔피언!\\n멋진 말도 다 하고![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "0DC139C9AC11B3CC",
      "text": "...뭔가 [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0303)]브라더시스터를\\n이용하기만 한 것 같네.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0303"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "0DC13AC9AC11B57F",
      "text": "그럴 의도는 없었지만,\\n그때는 나도 좀 흥분한 상태였거든.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_08",
      "hash64": "0DC13FC9AC11BDFE",
      "text": "그때 일은 이번 참에\\n다시금 사과할게.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "B48C79B064C08D59",
      "text": "왔구나, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "B48C78B064C08BA6",
      "text": "그래, 우리 리그부 부장께서는\\n오늘도 열심히 하고 있나?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "6F8FF36E35FFF045",
      "text": "부장이요!?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "6F8FF06E35FFEB2C",
      "text": "그게 무슨 소리예요?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "B48C77B064C089F3",
      "text": "어라? 전에 말하지 않았나?\\n리그부 부장은\\c\\n블루베리그 챔피언이 맡는 거랬잖아.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "6F8FF16E35FFECDF",
      "text": "지금 알았어요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "6F8FEE6E35FFE7C6",
      "text": "처음 들었어요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "B48C76B064C08840",
      "text": "이런, 실례!\\n아무튼 그렇게 됐어![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "B48C7DB064C09425",
      "text": "너무 걱정할 거 없어!\\n다들 도와줄 테니까![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "B48C7CB064C09272",
      "text": "내가 가장 강한 사람이었을 때도\\n챔피언이라고 하지 않는 대신[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "B48C7BB064C090BF",
      "text": "사천왕들이랑 다 같이\\n부장 업무를 나눠서 했거든!\\r\\n...혼자 하기 귀찮아서 말이야.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "B48C7AB064C08F0C",
      "text": "무슨 일 생기면 내가 책임질 테니까\\n부장은 너무 걱정하지 않아도 돼!![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "E24683B6C79C3788",
      "text": "왔구나, [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0303)]브라더시스터.\\n저번에 말한 부장 업무 말인데...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0303"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "E24684B6C79C393B",
      "text": "“[VAR 0x0100(0000)] 씨에게 전부 떠넘기다니,\\n 그런 건 옳지 않아!”[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "E24685B6C79C3AEE",
      "text": "...라면서 타로한테\\n호되게 혼났지 뭐야.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "E24686B6C79C3CA1",
      "text": "지금껏 농땡이 부렸던 것까지 끌고 와서\\n결국 전부 내가 맡기로 했어...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "5A53EBD7A9F6DDC2",
      "text": "힘내세요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "5A53EAD7A9F6DC0F",
      "text": "축하해요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "E24687B6C79C3E54",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)], 말은 고맙지만\\n이 제빈 님은 힘내는 게 질색이라고![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_04b",
      "hash64": "1A16D1952E7DB5C2",
      "text": "뭐라고!? [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0303)]브라더시스터...\\n그런 말도 할 줄 아는구나![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0303"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "E24688B6C79C4007",
      "text": "으~\\n귀찮아... 귀찮아~![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "E24689B6C79C41BA",
      "text": "혹시 도와줄 생각 있으면\\n언제든지 환영이니까 가져가 줘...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
